@startuml
title "Register new backoffice users"
actor Admin as A
actor User as U

A -> MEntraID : Login with Microsoft Entra ID
MEntraID -> A : Admin authenticated

A -> BackofficeController : Register new user (doctor, nurse, technician)
BackofficeController -> BackofficeService : Register new user request
BackofficeService -> MEntraID : Create new account (name, email, role)
MEntraID -> BackofficeService : Account created
BackofficeService -> MEntraID : Assign role (doctor, nurse, etc.)
MEntraID -> BackofficeService : Role assigned

BackofficeService -> MEntraID : Generate one-time setup link
MEntraID -> BackofficeService : Link generated
BackofficeService -> BackofficeController : Return setup link
BackofficeController -> User : Send setup link via email

User -> MEntraID : Access link to set password
MEntraID -> User : Enforce strong password policy
User -> MEntraID : Set password and activate account

MEntraID -> BackofficeService : User account activated
BackofficeService -> BackofficeController : Notify admin of successful registration
BackofficeController -> Admin : Notify admin

BackofficeController -> User : Send confirmation email
@enduml

